[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3084\u3063\u3071\u308A\u3059\u3054\u3044\u306D\u3047\u3001\u30EA\u30F3\u30C7\u796D\u3063\u3066\u3002\n\u672C\u756A\u306F\u307E\u3060\u3082\u3046\u5C11\u3057\u5148\u306A\u306E\u306B\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The Linde Festival really is amazing, isn\u0027t it? And it\u0027s not even starting for a while..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3059\u3067\u306B\u591A\u304F\u306E\u304A\u5E97\u3067\u3001\n\u72EC\u5275\u7684\u306A\u30C1\u30E7\u30B3\u304C\u58F2\u308A\u51FA\u3055\u308C\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Many shops are already selling their own unique chocolates."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304D\u3063\u3068\u5F7C\u3089\u3082\u3001\u30EA\u30F3\u30C7\u796D\u306B\u5411\u3051\u3066\n\u7814\u7A76\u3092\u9032\u3081\u3066\u3044\u305F\u306B\u9055\u3044\u3042\u308A\u307E\u305B\u3093",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "They must have been working hard on their research for the festival."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3060\u3088\u306D\u3002\u3069\u3053\u3082\u3059\u3054\u304F\u529B\u304C\u5165\u3063\u3066\u308B\u3082\u3093\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah! Everyone\u0027s really putting their all into it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3069\u308C\u3082\u3053\u308C\u3082\u7F8E\u5473\u3057\u305D\u3046\u3067\n\u4F55\u304B\u3089\u98DF\u3079\u308B\u304B\u8FF7\u3063\u3061\u3083\u3046\u306A\u3041",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Everything looks so delicious, I can\u0027t decide what to try first..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u3067\u3059\u306D\u3002\n\u3069\u3053\u304B\u3089\u624B\u3092\u3064\u3051\u305F\u3089\u3088\u3044\u3082\u306E\u304B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Indeed. It\u0027s hard to know where to begin."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304A\u3084\uFF1F\u3000\u4E8C\u4EBA\u3068\u3082",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh? If it isn\u0027t you two."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\uFF01\u3000\u3053\u3093\u306B\u3061\u306F\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna! Hello!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3069\u3046\u3082\u3002\u4F55\u304B\u60A9\u3093\u3067\u3044\u308B\u69D8\u5B50\u3060\u304C\u3001\n\u3069\u3046\u304B\u3057\u305F\u306E\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hello. You seem troubled about something. Is everything alright?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3041\u3001\u5B9F\u306F\u3067\u3059\u306D\u3002\n\u3082\u3046\u3059\u3050\u30EA\u30F3\u30C7\u796D\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044\u3067\u3059\u304B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, well... you know how the Linde Festival is coming up?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF\u3068\u30C1\u30E7\u30B3\u3092\u8D08\u308A\u5408\u304A\u3046\u3068\u601D\u3063\u3066\u3066\u3002\n\u5E02\u8CA9\u306E\u30C1\u30E7\u30B3\u3092\u52C9\u5F37\u3057\u306B\u304D\u305F\u3093\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta and I were planning to exchange chocolates. We came to study what\u0027s being sold in stores."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3067\u3059\u304C\u3001\u5E97\u3082\u5546\u54C1\u3082\u3068\u3066\u3082\u591A\u304F\n\u3069\u3053\u304B\u3089\u56DE\u308D\u3046\u304B\u3068\u60A9\u3093\u3067\u3044\u307E\u3057\u3066",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But there are so many shops and products, we\u0027re having trouble deciding where to start."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3075\u3080\u3002\u305D\u3046\u3044\u3046\u3053\u3068\u306A\u3089\u3001\u79C1\u3082\u5354\u529B\u3057\u3088\u3046",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm. In that case, I\u0027ll help."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3061\u3087\u3046\u3069\u8857\u306E\u898B\u56DE\u308A\u3092\u3057\u3066\u3044\u305F\u3068\u3053\u308D\u3067\u306A\u3002\n\u9053\u4E2D\u3067\u8272\u3093\u306A\u30C1\u30E7\u30B3\u3092\u898B\u304B\u3051\u305F\u3093\u3060",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I was just making my rounds through town. I\u0027ve seen quite a variety of chocolates along the way."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4EBA\u6C17\u306E\u3042\u308B\u5E97\u3082\u3044\u304F\u3064\u304B\u3042\u3063\u305F\u3002\n\u6709\u76CA\u306A\u60C5\u5831\u3092\u63D0\u4F9B\u3067\u304D\u308B\u3068\u601D\u3046",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There are several popular shops. I believe I can provide some useful information."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u672C\u5F53\u3067\u3059\u304B\uFF01\u3000\u305C\u3072\u6559\u3048\u3066\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Really? Please tell us!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3041\u3001\u69CB\u308F\u306A\u3044",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course, I don\u0027t mind."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u307E\u305A\u306F\u3001\u5411\u3053\u3046\u306E\u901A\u308A\u306B\u3042\u308B\u83D3\u5B50\u5C4B\u3060\u306A\u3002\n\u304B\u308F\u3044\u3089\u3057\u3044\u5F62\u306E\u30C1\u30E7\u30B3\u304C\u8C4A\u5BCC\u306B\u4E26\u3093\u3067\u3044\u305F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "First, there\u0027s a confectionery down that street. They have an abundance of chocolates in cute shapes."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u8EFD\u304F\u306E\u305E\u3044\u3066\u307F\u305F\u304C\u3001\u3069\u308C\u3082\u826F\u3044\u51FA\u6765\u3060\u3063\u305F\u3002\n\u3042\u3042\u3044\u3046\u5DE5\u592B\u304C\u3042\u308B\u3068\u3001\u8D08\u3089\u308C\u305F\u5074\u3082\u5B09\u3057\u3044\u3060\u308D\u3046\u306A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I took a brief look, and they all seemed well-made. Such creative touches would surely please the recipient."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5F62\u3082\u3001\u304A\u83D3\u5B50\u306E\u5927\u4E8B\u306A\u8981\u7D20\u3067\u3059\u304B\u3089\u306D\u3002\n\u79C1\u3082\u5F8C\u3067\u898B\u3066\u307F\u305F\u3044\u3068\u3053\u308D\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Shape is indeed an important element of confectionery. I\u0027d like to take a look myself later."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u3068\u3001\u3042\u3061\u3089\u306E\u5C4B\u53F0\u3082\u826F\u304B\u3063\u305F\u305E\u3002\n\u30C1\u30E7\u30B3\u5165\u308A\u306E\u6E29\u304B\u3044\u98F2\u307F\u7269\u3092\u58F2\u3063\u3066\u3044\u305F\u3093\u3060\u304C",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And that stall over there is good too. They\u0027re selling warm drinks with chocolate in them."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u9999\u3070\u3057\u3044\u5302\u3044\u304C\u8FBA\u308A\u306B\u6F02\u3063\u3066\u3044\u3066\u306A\u3002\n\u968F\u5206\u3068\u9577\u3044\u884C\u5217\u304C\u3067\u304D\u3066\u3044\u305F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The aromatic scent fills the air. There was quite a long line."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3078\u3047\u30FC\u3001\u98F2\u307F\u3082\u306E\u304B\u3041\uFF01\n\u78BA\u304B\u306B\u305D\u3046\u3044\u3046\u30C1\u30E7\u30B3\u3082\u3042\u308A\u3067\u3059\u3088\u306D\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ooh, drinks! That\u0027s definitely another way to go!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3072\u3068\u307E\u305A\u305D\u3093\u306A\u3068\u3053\u308D\u3060\u3002\n\u3069\u3046\u3060\u3001\u53C2\u8003\u306B\u306A\u3063\u305F\u3060\u308D\u3046\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That\u0027s all I have for now. Was that helpful?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306F\u3044\uFF01\u3000\u3042\u308A\u304C\u3068\u3046\u3054\u3056\u3044\u307E\u3059\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes! Thank you so much!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA\u306E\u8A71\u306F\u5206\u304B\u308A\u3084\u3059\u3044\u3067\u3059\u306D\u3002\n\u307E\u308B\u3067\u5B9F\u969B\u306B\u98DF\u3079\u3066\u304D\u305F\u304B\u306E\u3088\u3046\u306A\u53E3\u3076\u308A\u3067\u3057\u305F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna\u0027s descriptions are very clear. You speak as if you\u0027ve actually tasted them."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306A\u3063\u3002\n\u3044\u3001\u3044\u3084\u3002\u5225\u306B\u98DF\u3079\u3066\u306F\u3044\u306A\u3044\u305E\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wha- N-no, I haven\u0027t eaten any!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u79C1\u306F\u738B\u56FD\u9A0E\u58EB\u3068\u3057\u3066\u8857\u3092\u898B\u56DE\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3093\u3060\u3002\n\u3044\u3064\u3044\u304B\u306A\u308B\u6642\u3082\u3001\u6A21\u7BC4\u7684\u3067\u306A\u3051\u308C\u3070\u306A\u3089\u306A\u3044",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I am a Royal Knight patrolling the town. I must be exemplary at all times."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30EA\u30F3\u30C7\u796D\u306E\u958B\u50AC\u3092\u795D\u3044\u3053\u305D\u3059\u308C\u3001\n\u7121\u95C7\u306B\u306F\u3057\u3083\u3050\u3088\u3046\u306A\u884C\u70BA\u306F\u3057\u306A\u3044",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "While I celebrate the Linde Festival, I would never engage in such frivolous behavior."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u306A\u306E\u3067\u3059\u306D\u3002\u3066\u3063\u304D\u308A\u30E6\u30CA\u3082\u3001\n\u8AB0\u304B\u306B\u8D08\u308B\u30C1\u30E7\u30B3\u3092\u63A2\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B\u306E\u304B\u3068",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Is that so? I thought perhaps you were also looking for chocolates to give someone."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3044\u3001\u3044\u3084\u3044\u3084\uFF01\n\u305D\u3093\u306A\u3053\u3068\u306F\u3057\u3066\u3044\u306A\u304F\u3066\u3060\u306A\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "N-no, no! I\u0027m not doing anything of the sort..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304A\u3063\u3068\u3001\u305D\u308D\u305D\u308D\u898B\u56DE\u308A\u3092\u518D\u958B\u3057\u306A\u3051\u308C\u3070\u3002\n\u3067\u306F\u4E8C\u4EBA\u3068\u3082\u3001\u9811\u5F35\u3063\u3066\u304F\u308C",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, I should resume my patrol. Good luck, you two."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
